Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.18.51-rt57 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.18.51 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.18-rt
  Head SHA1: 6a22e2fa746cc117253522d7abc9c8baafd2eaf1


Or to build 3.18.51-rt57 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.18.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.18.51.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.18/patch-3.18.51-rt57.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

